the Hell you want to put i has been that we often have no idea what is bein=
g negated.=A0 That seems to be the case with UInai.=A0 Alas, both obvious p=
ossibilities have clear cases of being what is needed and clear cases of wh=
at is just nonsensical, and a vast majority mof cases where either would wo=
rk and be useful but there is no good argument for one rather than the othe=
r.=A0 The tendency seems to be to treat them all alike and hide the ridicul=
ous cases as best you can, but, since matters started off with some going o=
ne way and some the other, it is not clear which way to treat them all.=A0 =
(Of course, it is not clear that all UI need the possibility of a negation =
around, but that is too radical a notion to get much traction.)




